OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 29 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GMark Forrest introdcues specially
OL,6,     Grecorded concert performances
OL,7,     Gfrom today's featured conductor,
OL,8,     GRiccardo Muti, including a great
OL,9,     Gchoral tour-de-force from Anton
OL,10,     GBruckner.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Miles Davis
OL,12,     F100
OL,13,     GKate Molleson and American jazz
OL,14,     Gcritic Nate Chinen discuss the
OL,15,     Glast chapter in the life and work
OL,16,     Gof Miles Davis.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GKatie Derham welcomes Sir Karl
OL,19,     GJenkins to the studio. She is
OL,20,     Galso joined by pianist Joanna
OL,21,     GKacperek for a live performance.
